        "ggWRoQI2K_D_text": "FAQs",
        "ggdLseVBeKv_text": "<p>Absolutely. The water pressure is gentle yet effective, suitable even for sensitive gums.</p>",
        "ggiygJVPX4J_text": "<p>Yes, the targeted water jet reaches tight spaces and removes plaque more effectively than string floss.</p>",
        "ggur6bbjHEM_text": "<p>For optimal oral health, use Gsmile once daily, ideally before bedtime, for cleaner teeth and healthier gums.</p>"
      },
